        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 11:27PM AKDT until September 26 at 6:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 35 kt and
seas 6 to 8 ft expected.

* WHERE...Clarence Strait.

* WHEN...From 10 AM to 6 PM AKDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
